h2#endnote { ❖ Endnote }

Thank you for taking the time to read however much of this you did. I may push out updates to this page and the renderer from time to time.

For readers not familiar with the idea of the Lyapunov exponent, I had originally intended to include a section building up to that from more basic ideas. However, for the sake of getting this article ready to publish without compromising the quality of that explanation, I have opted to move it into its own article, which I hope to publish in the near future.

}


